      "widgets_values": [
        "Cinematic photorealistic live-action superhero battle, horizontal 16:9, matching the supplied initial reference frame exactly in composition, subject placement, scale, lighting and color palette. A devastated city avenue at sunset: shattered high-rise buildings, a collapsed elevated roadway, wrecked cars, broken asphalt and rubble, smoke columns and scattered fires under dramatic orange and blue storm clouds. On the left, an original female armored superhuman with short dark hair hovers above the rubble in a dark metallic blue-black suit and flowing black cape; vivid blue electricity wraps her armor and radiates from her open hand. On the right, an original muscular dark-haired male armored superhuman stands in a wide fighting stance in a black combat suit with red armor accents; red energy crackles around both fists and forearms. Preserve the two-character composition, silhouettes, armor design, blue-versus-red energy contrast and ruined-city background from the initial reference. Make the fight dynamic immediately: the hovering blue-energy fighter surges forward with a fast aerial feint and lightning strike, the red-energy fighter pivots, lunges and answers with rapid heavy punches, blue lightning and red energy collide, rubble lifts, sparks and dust burst outward, capes and smoke whip in the shockwave. Use a cinematic push-in with a subtle handheld impact shake and clear readable full-body motion, continuous shot, no cuts, no gore, no dialogue, no text, no logos, no extra characters, no anatomy distortion, no duplicated limbs, no costume changes, no flicker and no smeared faces.",
        1344,
        768,
        124
      ],
      "title": "Prompt + AV latent — detailed superhero action (1344x768, 5.2s)",
